  data:
    Id: juggernaut
    DisplayName: Juggernaut
    Description: 'Enough weight behind the swing to stagger whatever it lands on.
      Elemental family: Physical, the stagger-proc half -- Hardened carries the on-hit
      damage and Ironclad carries the resistance; this used to ride along with both
      on one bundled Hardened roll, now it is its own affix.'
    SortOrder: 14
    Effects:
    - Type: 9
      Magnitude: 8
      Threshold: 0
      AgainstType: 0
      HasAgainst: 0
      AgainstMagical: 0
